message: Please cite this article when referring to its philosophical argument or research programme.
title: 'The Logical Starting Point of Mathematical Logic and Natural Generation: Philosophical Ideas,
  Mathematical and Physical Pictures, and a Research Programme'
authors: &id001
- family-names: Guo
  given-names: Jinku
  affiliation: Northwestern Polytechnical University
